OL,3,GNEWSADeath initially probed as murder
OL,4,Awas drug overdose
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe death of a woman that initially
OL,7,Fprompted a murder arrest was caused by
OL,8,Fan unintentional drug overdose, a
OL,9,Fcoroner has said.
OL,11,FKirah Sines, 26, from Bagshot, Surrey,
OL,12,Fdied suddenly in Jameston, Bracknell,
OL,13,FBerkshire, on 4 June 2024.
OL,15,FPolice arrested a 27-year-old man from
OL,16,FWoking on suspicion of her murder but
OL,17,Fhe was later released and the criminal
OL,18,Finvestigation was dropped.
OL,20,FCoroner Alison McCormick concluded
OL,21,FSines' death was caused by combined
OL,22,Fdrug toxicity.
